     "body": "<p>Just as a note for any future broken macros: they can be accessed through the page attachments and downloaded as json files. These can then be used with <a href=\"http://draw.io\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">draw.io</a> or another service to import/export the diagrams as whatever attachment we want to display it as. Gliffy requires an enterprise edition to export, so it can’t be done using their free trial.</p>",
