     "body": "<p>I renamed Auto-versioning page to Versioning in Fedora 6 and updated the diagrams to display as svgs (though confluence makes it a pain to do so another filetype might be better).</p>\n\n<p>I don't think we need a separate page for the Mutable Head information as the current page does a good job outlining its use.</p>",
